# CI gate

Before finishing any task that touches Rust code, run in order:

```bash
cargo fmt --all
cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings
cargo nextest run --workspace
```

If `cargo nextest` is not installed, `cargo test --workspace` is acceptable locally — CI uses nextest.

`cargo audit` is optional locally but runs in CI; run it when touching dependencies.

Do not claim work is complete until these pass. Fix failures before committing.
